      "id": "claim_d1246c0761534c0ead210fd9277da747",
      "statement": "For plan years beginning on or after 2027-01-01, DOL Release 2026-31 widens the permitted corridor around 25-year average segment rates from 10% to 20% in each direction; the release states that this can permit a higher liability discount rate and lower measured liabilities.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://external_sources/DOL/2026-08-funding-relief-and-discount-rates.md#L7-L17",
