        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7e49c9591c3b41908a4ab11d124552fc",
      "statement": "Under DOL Release 2026-31, a plan measured above 110% funded under the new corridor is not required to make a minimum contribution for that plan year; a sponsor may elect the excess for qualified replacement-plan transfers or retiree-health accounts, must notify participants within 30 days of electing relief, and receives no new sponsor reversion outside the existing statutory framework.",
