    {
      "id": "claim_2da33b8a9ed546ac9def537fa260ae78",
      "statement": "DOL Release 2026-31 P.2 and P.3 supersede FI-US-PENSION-LDI 2026-03 L.2's funding-rule premise for plan years beginning on or after 2027-01-01: the note says that a rule change allowing surplus release or re-risking can reverse its long-credit demand flow, and L.6 names altered discount-rate basis or reduced contributions as a condition that ends the recommendation.",
